slider18:2<0,5,1{Off,Every 2 bars,Every 4 bars,Every 8 bars,Every 16 bars,By chance}>-Fill
slider19:25<0,100,1>-Fill chance (%)
slider20:50<0,100,1>-Fill intensity (%)
slider21:0<0,2,1{Last beat,Last half bar,Whole bar}>-Fill length
slider22:0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Kick mute
slider23:0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Snare mute
slider24:0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Closed hat mute
slider25:0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Open hat mute
slider26:0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Clap-rim mute
slider27:0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Low tom mute
slider28:0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-High tom mute
slider29:0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Cymbal-perc mute
slider30:75<0,100,1>-Kick level (%)
slider31:75<0,100,1>-Snare level (%)
